1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body.

2
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Lady Arachne. I can't feel her soul.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
My mistress has lost to me forever.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Kumbach.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Kumbach!

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,080
I'm falling, coming to my shadow

7
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:09,520
息をひそめて

8
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:13,080
待っている Dead Dream Life

9
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:18,080
Don't scare me,君が望めば

10
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,660
どんな世界も

11
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:25,640
その目に映せるから

12
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:30,060
See you in your dreams, yeah, baby

13
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:36,640
怖い夢だとしても

14
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:40,880
全部君のために

15
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:43,780
星を砕ぎ

16
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:46,700
飾り付けた

17
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:48,300
Black paper

18
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:51,980
信じてくれたなら

19
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:55,620
When you lost it

20
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:57,040
We are young

21
00:01:57,040 --> 00:02:00,280
Forever with your soul

22
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:04,220
見上げれば輝く

23
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:06,620
月のように

24
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:14,620
Baka

25
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:25,600
Are you sure you're ready for this?

26
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,860
I'm ready for anything

27
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:30,120
Lord Death can't fight anymore

28
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,020
It's up to us now

29
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:40,900
Ashura wakes

30
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:42,280
To the end of the world

31
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:42,700
To the end of the world

32
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:48,660
Is that him?

33
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,500
Yes, it's the Kishin

34
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,840
You can almost feel the evil coming from him

35
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,320
Let's get him, Tsubaki

36
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:55,780
Right

37
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:58,380
Hold on a sec, Blackstar

38
00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,240
I'm coming

39
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,780
No, Mufune

40
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:02,640
You need to take that midget

41
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,760
And get out of here quickly

42
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:03,800
And get out of here quickly

43
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,180
Hey, you dummy

44
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:06,220
Take that back

45
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:07,560
Angie's not a midget

46
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:10,440
Are you sure you want to do this?

47
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,020
Yeah, I am

48
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:15,100
I'm the man who's gonna surpass God, remember?

49
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:17,100
Black Star

50
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:28,080
Not good

51
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,100
Not at all

52
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:31,400
What is that thing?

53
00:03:32,660 --> 00:03:33,680
A barrier

54
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,820
A barrier?

55
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,020
The Kishin was badly injured

56
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,480
During his fight with Lord Death

57
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:40,100
He's going into a deep sleep

58
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:40,640
To heal

59
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:43,380
No, he can't

60
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:45,080
If he does, then that means

61
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,920
The madness wavelength will continue to expand

62
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:50,380
His insanity will take over the world

63
00:03:50,380 --> 00:03:51,680
Without him lifting a finger

64
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:54,620
No, it won't

65
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:56,720
I can't sit here and let that happen

66
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:57,900
Liz

67
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:58,720
Patty

68
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:00,140
Yeah

69
00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:07,360
I will take my father's place

70
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,360
He can't fight now, but I can

71
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,020
As a grim reaper

72
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:12,880
I will protect this world

73
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:19,380
Kid, where are you going?

74
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,760
You can't just run off

75
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,720
Come back here!

76
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,440
You gonna charge in there without a Meister?

77
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,700
What good will that do?

78
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,240
Move it, move it, move it, move it, move it, move it, move it!

79
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:49,220
Ahhhhhh...

80
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:50,260
Ahhhhhh...

81
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:57,220
Yoh, Maka, gettin' here a little late, aren't ya?

82
00:04:57,220 --> 00:05:00,240
Sorry, I had some things to take care of

83
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:03,240
So we all began this battle in different places

84
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,680
And yet here we are back together at the end of it

85
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,500
Yep, I'm not complaining

86
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,500
Yeah, neither am I.

87
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:14,500
All right. Keep a tight rein on your souls at all times.

88
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,500
Do not let down your guard.

89
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:19,500
If you do, the madness will consume you.

90
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:21,500
We can't afford to let that happen.

91
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:25,500
We know. He got me last time.

92
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:33,500
But this time, I'm gonna make him pay!

93
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:38,500
To preserve this world and to avenge my father,

94
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:40,500
I will beat you.

95
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:50,500
If we manage to make it out of this alive,

96
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:52,500
something tells me ghosts won't scare me so much anymore.

97
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:56,500
Wow! That would make you as strong as the Grim Reaper.

98
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:59,500
Now, now, Patty. Let's not get too carried away, okay?

99
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:02,500
I'm not gonna be volunteering for that job anytime soon.

100
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,500
Can I?

101
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:06,500
Black Star. Yeah?

102
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,500
Is today the day?

103
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:11,500
Will this be the moment when you surpass God?

104
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:14,500
Yeah. Just watch me.

105
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:17,500
Okay, guys. Are we ready?

106
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:45,500
Hey, wait a second. That's not what he looked like a minute ago.

107
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:48,500
Yeah, he got a lot bigger. No fair.

108
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:51,500
He must have killed Arachne and swallowed her soul.

109
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:54,500
I couldn't care less what you look like, Chishin.

110
00:06:54,500 --> 00:06:58,500
I'm still gonna destroy you. Got it?

111
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:05,500
Insects. Yummy. Come closer, little insects.

112
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,500
Listen up.

113
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:11,500
Soul is about to play. Everyone ready?

114
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,500
Everyone ready?

115
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:29,500
Showtime. Now. Soul. Play it.

116
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:47,500
Impossible. That girl is combining two incredible powers.

117
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:53,500
Black Blood and Genie Hunter working together?

118
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:55,500
Let's go!

119
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:01,500
His skin is as hard as armor.

120
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:05,500
Our attacks are working, though. Let's keep it coming.

121
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:08,500
You ready to go, Maka?

122
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:18,500
Damn! Are you sure this is working?

123
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:20,500
Yes, I'm positive. Just look around you.

124
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:24,500
Up there!

125
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:27,500
The barrier he's set up is starting to weaken.

126
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:29,500
That's proof we're doing something.

127
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:30,500
It does look a bit thinner.

128
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:32,500
That's good, right?

129
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:34,500
We're resonating well together, too.

130
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:37,500
If we keep this up, we can beat him.

131
00:08:38,500 --> 00:08:39,500
What's happening?

132
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:41,500
Something's off.

133
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,500
It feels like I'm forgetting something important.

134
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,500
Something I need to remember.

135
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:48,500
But what is it?

136
00:08:59,500 --> 00:09:00,500
Keep going.

137
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:01,500
Let's pick up the tempo!

138
00:09:01,500 --> 00:09:03,500
Hey, Soul, are you even listening to us?

139
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:06,500
Quit your whining. Of course I'm listening to you.

140
00:09:06,500 --> 00:09:09,500
You guys just shut up and pay attention to my playing.

141
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:10,500
Faster now!

142
00:09:10,500 --> 00:09:11,500
Get ready!

143
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:12,500
We're building to the climax!

144
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:13,500
We're building to the climax!

145
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:16,500
Fire jet cannon!

146
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:30,320
Fire jet cannon.

147
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,500
Genie!

148
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:05,500
Soul!

149
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:15,500
This is the end of the line, Soul.

150
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:18,500
You played your last tune.

151
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:20,500
It's my world now.

152
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:25,500
Soul!

153
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:35,500
That's impossible. No way.

154
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:37,500
He's still as good as new.

155
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:39,500
There's no sign of a single injury.

156
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:51,500
The surgery went well. We just need to keep him stable. Given enough time, he should make a full recovery.

157
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:53,000
We just need to keep him stable.

158
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:55,560
Given enough time, he should make a full recovery.

159
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:57,760
Yeah, that's good to hear.

160
00:10:58,540 --> 00:11:00,000
But still...

161
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,960
Still what?

162
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:05,060
It's just that I said something I'll never be able to take back.

163
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,700
I told Crona I didn't trust him,

164
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:10,320
that I never would again unless we recovered you.

165
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:13,380
I was there with him the whole time,

166
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:15,620
but I couldn't keep him from getting injured.

167
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:18,780
He's hurt because I forced him into fighting Medusa.

168
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,440
It's all my fault.

169
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:23,500
So why not tell him that?

170
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:27,100
Crona's going to be all right.

171
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:30,060
You can tell him how you feel when he wakes up.

172
00:11:30,500 --> 00:11:31,900
I'm sure he'll forgive you.

173
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:40,940
Crona, are you okay?

174
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,260
Crona!

175
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:44,420
Can't stay. I have to go.

176
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:47,920
I have to go find Maka.

177
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:58,740
You're persistent.

178
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,080
How long are you going to keep this up?

179
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:03,280
They've obviously betrayed you.

180
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,680
Oh, don't worry.

181
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:06,860
I'm going to pay them back with interest.

182
00:12:06,860 --> 00:12:09,740
But before I do that, I'm going to take care of you!

183
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:12,020
Who's next on this list?

184
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,600
Who do you think?

185
00:12:13,980 --> 00:12:15,420
It'll be that old hag Arach...

186
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:18,040
Oh, really?

187
00:12:18,380 --> 00:12:20,140
Well, I guess you can always try.

188
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,940
But I think you'll find it's a little too late for that.

189
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:24,760
What's that supposed to mean?

190
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:26,760
Someone beat you to it.

191
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,680
She's already dead.

192
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:28,780
She is?

193
00:12:29,380 --> 00:12:31,820
Haven't you noticed you're the only one still fighting?

194
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,720
Everyone else has begun to retreat.

195
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:36,060
Arachnophobia's destroyed.

196
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,100
You're alone.

197
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,760
There's no way...

198
00:12:39,300 --> 00:12:40,980
You have a decision to make.

199
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:44,320
DWMA troops will be flooding in here soon.

200
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:48,000
You can run or fight all of them by yourself.

201
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:52,000
Fine, you lucky punk.

202
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,360
I'll go easy on you today.

203
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,220
Cat got your tongue?

204
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,560
Just remember one thing.

205
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,760
I'm still going to kick your ass someday!

206
00:13:04,380 --> 00:13:05,360
Look at that.

207
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:08,240
I know you so well, I can predict your foul language.

208
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:09,680
Shut up!

209
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:12,480
I've had enough, you damn priest!

210
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:15,120
The next time we meet, you're not going to be so lucky!

211
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:17,020
Remember that!

212
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:27,680
What is it?

213
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,360
A barrier the Kishin created.

214
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:31,480
We think it's similar to the Death Room.

215
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,360
Impenetrable from the outside.

216
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:35,720
I see.

217
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:38,980
The spread of the madness hasn't even slowed down.

218
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:41,200
I don't know what more we can try to do.

219
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:44,380
We made Death City move, but we still couldn't beat the Kishin.

220
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:45,460
Fools!

221
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:47,520
What do you use your eyes for?

222
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,320
Decoration?

223
00:13:49,940 --> 00:13:53,800
His eyes look like a failed arts and crafts project, and he's asking me that?

224
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:56,440
There's still a slight hope.

225
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,420
What are you talking about?

226
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:00,620
Three Meisters made it inside.

227
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:03,980
Death the Kid's there, with Blackstar, and Maka Albarn.

228
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:05,660
They all have their weapons with them.

229
00:14:05,660 --> 00:14:06,660
The battle's not over.

230
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:07,420
The battle's not over.

231
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:08,620
We've still got a chance.

232
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,860
Maka and the others are in there?

233
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:13,160
Victory still isn't very likely.

234
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:16,200
But if Maka can use her Genie Hunter move, then maybe.

235
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:18,160
Yes, you're right.

236
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:23,000
If Maka can harness enough power at the right time, then she might be able to defeat the Kishin.

237
00:14:23,620 --> 00:14:25,820
That doesn't change anything for us up here.

238
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:26,300
Huh?

239
00:14:26,300 --> 00:14:30,200
All we can do is stand here and watch.

240
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,240
Sol!

241
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:35,520
Sol!

242
00:14:36,020 --> 00:14:36,700
Wake up!

243
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:39,000
What's going on?

244
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:40,540
What happened?

245
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:41,880
Why is he just lying there?

246
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,620
I don't understand what's wrong with him either.

247
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:45,360
Maybe.

248
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,800
Your friend bit off more than he could chew.

249
00:14:49,340 --> 00:14:49,720
He what?

250
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:52,000
What the?

251
00:14:52,100 --> 00:14:52,840
Where did he go?

252
00:14:52,840 --> 00:15:00,800
He did whatever he had to in order to push all your powers to their maximum potential,

253
00:15:01,220 --> 00:15:03,160
which increased the burden on himself.

254
00:15:03,660 --> 00:15:06,520
This has been a long time coming indeed.

255
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:09,360
Because of the black blood he has in his body?

256
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:11,600
Every power comes with a price.

257
00:15:12,020 --> 00:15:15,600
In this case, it was his sanity, but he wasn't willing to give it up.

258
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,880
He wanted both.

259
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:20,460
If he had just given in, everything would have been different.

260
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:24,540
If he'd done that, he would have known a life without fear.

261
00:15:26,060 --> 00:15:30,540
But he refused, and chose instead to pointlessly destroy himself.

262
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:35,400
Shut up, jackass.

263
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,820
You don't know what you're talking about.

264
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:37,360
Quiet.

265
00:15:37,700 --> 00:15:39,020
He's trying to provoke us.

266
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:41,060
We can't afford to get caught up in that.

267
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,860
Why should I care?

268
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,140
This is my show.

269
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:45,860
He can say anything he wants to me.

270
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,620
One way or another, he's still gonna die today!

271
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:53,360
No way!

272
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,340
He did that using only his wavelength?

273
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,460
I shouldn't be surprised.

274
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,640
It is Blackstar.

275
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:02,300
But we still have a problem.

276
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:05,940
